{"css": "\nbody{margin:0;background:#F6F4F0;font-family:'Hanken Grotesk',system-ui,sans-serif;color:#1A1918}\na{color:#1A1918}a:hover{color:#6B6660}\n.cap{font-size:12px;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:0.18em;text-transform:uppercase}\n.wrap{max-width:1440px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 64px;box-sizing:border-box}\n.slot{background:#E3DED6;color:#6B6660;display:flex;align-items:flex-end;padding:16px;box-sizing:border-box;font-size:14px;line-height:1.5}\n.line{height:3px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#F43F5E,#A855F7)}\n.fld{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:6px;font-size:14px}\n.fld input,.fld select{padding:14px;border:1px solid #DCD6CD;background:#F6F4F0;font:inherit;color:#1A1918}\n@media (max-width:760px){.wrap{padding:0 20px}}\n.ph{display:block;width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover}\n", "body": "\n\n\n\n\n\n<div style=\"font-family: 'Hanken Grotesk', system-ui, sans-serif; color: #1A1918; background: #F6F4F0; min-height: 100vh\">\n\n  <div style=\"background: #EDE9E3; border-bottom: 1px solid #DCD6CD;\">\n    <div class=\"wrap\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px 32px; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; min-height: 44px\">\n      <nav aria-label=\"MIRAKLE worlds\" style=\"display: flex; gap: 28px; flex-wrap: wrap\">\n        <a class=\"cap\" href=\"/architectural/\" style=\"text-decoration: none; padding: 12px 0; color: #6B6660\">Architectural</a>\n        <a class=\"cap\" href=\"/quiklit/\" aria-current=\"page\" style=\"text-decoration: none; padding: 12px 0; font-weight: 500; color: #1A1918; border-bottom: 2px solid #A855F7\">QuikLit</a>\n        <a class=\"cap\" href=\"/decorative/\" style=\"text-decoration: none; padding: 12px 0; color: #6B6660\">Decorative</a>\n      </nav>\n      <a class=\"cap\" href=\"/\" style=\"text-decoration: none; padding: 12px 0; color: #6B6660\">MIRAKLE home</a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <header class=\"wrap\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 16px; padding-top: 20px; padding-bottom: 20px\">\n    <div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 16px\">\n      <img src=\"/img/quiklit-black.png\" alt=\"QuikLit\" style=\"height: 24px; width: auto; display: block\">\n      <a href=\"/\" aria-label=\"MIRAKLE home\" style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; text-decoration: none; padding-left: 16px; border-left: 1px solid #DCD6CD\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px; color: #6B6660\">by</span><img src=\"/img/Mirakle_Logo_Black.svg\" alt=\"MIRAKLE\" style=\"height: 20px; width: auto; display: block\"></a>\n    </div>\n    <nav aria-label=\"QuikLit\" style=\"display: flex; gap: 24px; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center\">\n      <a class=\"cap\" href=\"#profiles\" style=\"text-decoration: none\">Profiles</a>\n      <a class=\"cap\" href=\"#families\" style=\"text-decoration: none\">QuikMag</a>\n      <a class=\"cap\" href=\"#families\" style=\"text-decoration: none\">Spots &amp; sensors</a>\n      <a class=\"cap\" href=\"#families\" style=\"text-decoration: none\">Power</a>\n      <a class=\"cap\" href=\"#install\" style=\"text-decoration: none\">Install</a>\n      <a class=\"cap\" href=\"/quiklit/boq/\" style=\"text-decoration: none; background: #1A1918; color: #F6F4F0; padding: 12px 18px\">BOQ calculator</a>\n    </nav>\n  </header>\n  <div class=\"line\"></div>\n\n  <!-- Hero -->\n  <section class=\"wrap\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 48px; padding-top: 72px; padding-bottom: 80px; align-items: center\">\n    <div style=\"flex: 1 1 460px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 22px\">\n      <span class=\"cap\" style=\"color: #6B6660\">Furniture Lighting Collection 2027\u201328</span>\n      <h1 style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 56px; line-height: 1.0; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 300; letter-spacing: 0.03em\">Cut. Cap.<br>Connect. Light.</h1>\n      <p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 20px; line-height: 1.55; color: #6B6660; max-width: 520px\">Solder-free, plug-and-play 24V lighting for modular furniture: LED profiles, magnetic lights, spots, sensors and power supplies from one source.</p>\n      <div style=\"display: flex; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap\">\n        <a href=\"/quiklit/boq/\" class=\"cap\" style=\"text-decoration: none; background: #1A1918; color: #F6F4F0; padding: 16px 22px\">Build your BOQ</a>\n        <a href=\"#enquire\" class=\"cap\" style=\"text-decoration: none; border: 1px solid #1A1918; padding: 16px 22px\">Request a sample bag</a>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div style=\"flex: 1 1 560px; height: 480px; overflow: hidden; padding: 0; background: #DEDBD6\"><img class=\"ph\" src=\"/img/qmag2.jpg\" alt=\"QuikMag spots on a magnetic track under a wardrobe shelf\"></div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- Four steps -->\n  <section id=\"install\" style=\"background: #EDE9E3\">\n    <div class=\"wrap\" style=\"padding-top: 80px; padding-bottom: 80px; display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 32px\">\n      <div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px\"><div class=\"slot\" style=\"height: 180px; background: #F6F4F0\">Line drawing: profile on a mitre saw</div><span style=\"font-size: 40px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 300; letter-spacing: 0.03em\">01</span><span style=\"font-size: 20px; font-weight: 500\">Cut</span><span style=\"font-size: 16px; color: #6B6660; line-height: 1.5\">Measure and cut the profile to the length you need, between LED groups.</span></div>\n      <div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px\"><div class=\"slot\" style=\"height: 180px; background: #F6F4F0\">Line drawing: wired end cap fitted</div><span style=\"font-size: 40px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 300; letter-spacing: 0.03em\">02</span><span style=\"font-size: 20px; font-weight: 500\">Cap</span><span style=\"font-size: 16px; color: #6B6660; line-height: 1.5\">Fit the wired end cap at one end and close the other with an end cap.</span></div>\n      <div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px\"><div class=\"slot\" style=\"height: 180px; background: #F6F4F0\">Line drawing: Phoenix terminal into QuikPower</div><span style=\"font-size: 40px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 300; letter-spacing: 0.03em\">03</span><span style=\"font-size: 20px; font-weight: 500\">Connect</span><span style=\"font-size: 16px; color: #6B6660; line-height: 1.5\">Connect to the cabinet power supply with Phoenix terminals.</span></div>\n      <div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px\"><div class=\"slot\" style=\"height: 180px; background: #F6F4F0\">Line drawing: lit shelf</div><span style=\"font-size: 40px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 300; letter-spacing: 0.03em\">04</span><span style=\"font-size: 20px; font-weight: 500\">Light</span><span style=\"font-size: 16px; color: #6B6660; line-height: 1.5\">Plug in and it lights. No soldering anywhere.</span></div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- Profile selector -->\n  <section id=\"profiles\" class=\"wrap\" style=\"padding-top: 96px; padding-bottom: 96px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 32px\">\n    <div style=\"display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: baseline; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 12px\">\n      <h2 style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 40px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 300; letter-spacing: 0.03em\">Twelve solder-free profiles</h2>\n      <span style=\"font-size: 16px; color: #6B6660\">3000K or 4000K \u00b7 24V DC \u00b7 sections at true size on each page</span>\n    </div>\n    <div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(250px, 1fr)); gap: 16px\">\n      \n        <a href=\"#profiles\" style=\"text-decoration: none; border: 1px solid #DCD6CD; padding: 20px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px\">\n          <div class=\"slot\" style=\"height: 120px; background: #EDE9E3; align-items: center; justify-content: center\">1:1 section</div>\n          <span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500\">QUIKLIT-1707 \u00b7 NEW</span>\n          <div style=\"display: flex; gap: 16px; font-size: 14px; color: #6B6660; flex-wrap: wrap\"><span>17 \u00d7 7 mm</span><span>16 W/m</span></div>\n          <span class=\"cap\" style=\"font-size: 12px; color: #6B6660\">Recessed</span>\n        </a>\n      \n        <a href=\"#profiles\" style=\"text-decoration: none; border: 1px solid #DCD6CD; padding: 20px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px\">\n          <div class=\"slot\" style=\"height: 120px; background: #EDE9E3; align-items: center; justify-content: center\">1:1 section</div>\n          <span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500\">QUIKTILT-1010-150 \u00b7 NEW</span>\n          <div style=\"display: flex; gap: 16px; font-size: 14px; color: #6B6660; flex-wrap: wrap\"><span>10 \u00d7 10 mm</span><span>14 W/m</span></div>\n          <span class=\"cap\" style=\"font-size: 12px; color: #6B6660\">Recessed</span>\n        </a>\n      \n        <a href=\"#profiles\" style=\"text-decoration: none; border: 1px solid #DCD6CD; padding: 20px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px\">\n          <div class=\"slot\" style=\"height: 120px; background: #EDE9E3; align-items: center; justify-content: center\">1:1 section</div>\n          <span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500\">QUIKLIT-0609</span>\n          <div style=\"display: flex; gap: 16px; font-size: 14px; color: #6B6660; flex-wrap: wrap\"><span>6 \u00d7 9 mm</span><span>9 W/m</span></div>\n          <span class=\"cap\" style=\"font-size: 12px; color: #6B6660\">Recessed</span>\n        </a>\n      \n        <a href=\"#profiles\" style=\"text-decoration: none; border: 1px solid #DCD6CD; padding: 20px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px\">\n          <div class=\"slot\" style=\"height: 120px; background: #EDE9E3; align-items: center; justify-content: center\">1:1 section</div>\n          <span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500\">QUIKLIT-0809</span>\n          <div style=\"display: flex; gap: 16px; font-size: 14px; color: #6B6660; flex-wrap: wrap\"><span>8 \u00d7 9 mm</span><span>9 W/m</span></div>\n          <span class=\"cap\" style=\"font-size: 12px; color: #6B6660\">Recessed</span>\n        </a>\n      \n        <a href=\"#profiles\" style=\"text-decoration: none; border: 1px solid #DCD6CD; padding: 20px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px\">\n          <div class=\"slot\" style=\"height: 120px; background: #EDE9E3; align-items: center; justify-content: center\">1:1 section</div>\n          <span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500\">QUIKLIT-1010</span>\n          <div style=\"display: flex; gap: 16px; font-size: 14px; color: #6B6660; flex-wrap: wrap\"><span>10 \u00d7 10 mm</span><span>14 W/m</span></div>\n          <span class=\"cap\" style=\"font-size: 12px; color: #6B6660\">Recessed</span>\n        </a>\n      \n        <a href=\"#profiles\" style=\"text-decoration: none; border: 1px solid #DCD6CD; padding: 20px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px\">\n          <div class=\"slot\" style=\"height: 120px; background: #EDE9E3; align-items: center; justify-content: center\">1:1 section</div>\n          <span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500\">QUIKLIT-ASYMMETRIC 1010</span>\n          <div style=\"display: flex; gap: 16px; font-size: 14px; color: #6B6660; flex-wrap: wrap\"><span>10 \u00d7 10 mm</span><span>14 W/m</span></div>\n          <span class=\"cap\" style=\"font-size: 12px; color: #6B6660\">Recessed</span>\n        </a>\n      \n        <a href=\"#profiles\" style=\"text-decoration: none; border: 1px solid #DCD6CD; padding: 20px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px\">\n          <div class=\"slot\" style=\"height: 120px; background: #EDE9E3; align-items: center; justify-content: center\">1:1 section</div>\n          <span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500\">QUIKLIT-1010 ECOFLEX</span>\n          <div style=\"display: flex; gap: 16px; font-size: 14px; color: #6B6660; flex-wrap: wrap\"><span>10 \u00d7 10 mm</span><span>9 W/m</span></div>\n          <span class=\"cap\" style=\"font-size: 12px; color: #6B6660\">Recessed</span>\n        </a>\n      \n        <a href=\"#profiles\" style=\"text-decoration: none; border: 1px solid #DCD6CD; padding: 20px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px\">\n          <div class=\"slot\" style=\"height: 120px; background: #EDE9E3; align-items: center; justify-content: center\">1:1 section</div>\n          <span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500\">QUIKLIT-1010 ECOMAX</span>\n          <div style=\"display: flex; gap: 16px; font-size: 14px; color: #6B6660; flex-wrap: wrap\"><span>10 \u00d7 10 mm</span><span>14 W/m</span></div>\n          <span class=\"cap\" style=\"font-size: 12px; color: #6B6660\">Recessed</span>\n        </a>\n      \n        <a href=\"#profiles\" style=\"text-decoration: none; border: 1px solid #DCD6CD; padding: 20px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px\">\n          <div class=\"slot\" style=\"height: 120px; background: #EDE9E3; align-items: center; justify-content: center\">1:1 section</div>\n          <span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500\">QUIKLIT-8MM GLASS</span>\n          <div style=\"display: flex; gap: 16px; font-size: 14px; color: #6B6660; flex-wrap: wrap\"><span>8 mm glass</span><span>9 W/m</span></div>\n          <span class=\"cap\" style=\"font-size: 12px; color: #6B6660\">Side panels</span>\n        </a>\n      \n        <a href=\"#profiles\" style=\"text-decoration: none; border: 1px solid #DCD6CD; padding: 20px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px\">\n          <div class=\"slot\" style=\"height: 120px; background: #EDE9E3; align-items: center; justify-content: center\">1:1 section</div>\n          <span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500\">QUIKLIT-0618 DUAL SIDE</span>\n          <div style=\"display: flex; gap: 16px; font-size: 14px; color: #6B6660; flex-wrap: wrap\"><span>6 \u00d7 18 mm</span><span>9 W/m</span></div>\n          <span class=\"cap\" style=\"font-size: 12px; color: #6B6660\">Shelf edge</span>\n        </a>\n      \n        <a href=\"#profiles\" style=\"text-decoration: none; border: 1px solid #DCD6CD; padding: 20px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px\">\n          <div class=\"slot\" style=\"height: 120px; background: #EDE9E3; align-items: center; justify-content: center\">1:1 section</div>\n          <span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500\">QUIKLIT-1313 CORNER</span>\n          <div style=\"display: flex; gap: 16px; font-size: 14px; color: #6B6660; flex-wrap: wrap\"><span>13 \u00d7 13 mm</span><span>9 W/m</span></div>\n          <span class=\"cap\" style=\"font-size: 12px; color: #6B6660\">Corner</span>\n        </a>\n      \n        <a href=\"#profiles\" style=\"text-decoration: none; border: 1px solid #DCD6CD; padding: 20px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px\">\n          <div class=\"slot\" style=\"height: 120px; background: #EDE9E3; align-items: center; justify-content: center\">1:1 section</div>\n          <span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500\">QUIKLIT-0408 NEON FLEX</span>\n          <div style=\"display: flex; gap: 16px; font-size: 14px; color: #6B6660; flex-wrap: wrap\"><span>4 \u00d7 8 mm</span><span>14 W/m</span></div>\n          <span class=\"cap\" style=\"font-size: 12px; color: #6B6660\">Groove</span>\n        </a>\n      \n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- Families -->\n  <section id=\"families\" style=\"background: #1A1918; color: #F6F4F0\">\n    <div class=\"line\"></div>\n    <div class=\"wrap\" style=\"padding-top: 80px; padding-bottom: 80px; display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(200px, 1fr)); gap: 32px\">\n      <div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px; font-weight: 500\">QuikMag</span><span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: #A39D94; line-height: 1.5\">One recessed track with flood bars, laser grills and spots that click on anywhere.</span></div>\n      <div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px; font-weight: 500\">QuikSpot</span><span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: #A39D94; line-height: 1.5\">A compact 1W spot with a replaceable CREE LED head, and the 1W EcoDot.</span></div>\n      <div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px; font-weight: 500\">QuikSens</span><span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: #A39D94; line-height: 1.5\">Door, presence, hand sweep and touch sensors with replaceable heads.</span></div>\n      <div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px; font-weight: 500\">QuikPower</span><span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: #A39D94; line-height: 1.5\">Ultra-slim 24V supplies: 60, 100, 150 W and Global 100 W.</span></div>\n      <div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px; font-weight: 500\">Accessories</span><span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: #A39D94; line-height: 1.5\">Splitter and extension wires, corner connectors and straight jointers.</span></div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"wrap\" style=\"padding-bottom: 56px; font-size: 14px; color: #A39D94\">Warranty: 5 years on QuikLit lights \u00b7 3 years on QuikSens and QuikPower \u00b7 accessories, connectors and wires not covered.</div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- Enquiry -->\n  <section id=\"enquire\" class=\"wrap\" style=\"padding-top: 96px; padding-bottom: 112px; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 56px; align-items: flex-start\">\n    <div style=\"flex: 1 1 360px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 16px\">\n      <span class=\"cap\" style=\"color: #6B6660\">For furniture makers</span>\n      <h2 style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 40px; line-height: 1.1; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 300; letter-spacing: 0.03em\">Try it in your factory first.</h2>\n      <p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; color: #6B6660\">Ask for the profiles sample bag or the QuikMag sample bag. The QuikLit team calls you within 24 hours.</p>\n      <span style=\"font-size: 14px\">Awadhesh Pal \u00b7 +91 92279 96634 \u00b7 quiklit@hrishalightings.com</span>\n    </div>\n    <form aria-label=\"QuikLit factory enquiry\" style=\"flex: 1 1 480px; display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 16px\">\n      <label class=\"fld\">Company<input type=\"text\"></label>\n      <label class=\"fld\">City<input type=\"text\"></label>\n      <label class=\"fld\">Your name<input type=\"text\"></label>\n      <label class=\"fld\">Mobile<input type=\"tel\"></label>\n      <label class=\"fld\">I am<select><option>Furniture manufacturer</option><option>Dealer</option><option>Interior designer</option><option>Installer</option></select></label>\n      <label class=\"fld\">We make<select><option>Kitchens</option><option>Wardrobes</option><option>Both</option><option>Other furniture</option></select></label>\n      <label class=\"fld\" style=\"grid-column: 1 / -1\">Approximate units per month<select><option>Under 20</option><option>20\u2013100</option><option>100\u2013500</option><option>Over 500</option></select></label>\n      <fieldset style=\"grid-column: 1 / -1; border: 0; padding: 0; margin: 0; display: flex; gap: 24px; flex-wrap: wrap; font-size: 14px\">\n        <legend style=\"font-size: 14px; padding: 0 0 8px\">Sample bag</legend>\n        <label style=\"display: flex; gap: 8px; align-items: center\"><input type=\"checkbox\"> Profiles sample bag</label>\n        <label style=\"display: flex; gap: 8px; align-items: center\"><input type=\"checkbox\"> QuikMag sample bag</label>\n      </fieldset>\n      <button type=\"button\" style=\"grid-column: 1 / -1; padding: 16px; background: #1A1918; color: #F6F4F0; border: 0; font: inherit; font-weight: 500; cursor: pointer\">Send to the QuikLit team</button>\n    </form>\n  </section>\n</div>\n", "footer": true}